  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 (RNA) and resnet50 (image) are strong individual encoders, but their combination in multimodal settings remains untested. This experiment tests multimodal fusion with scvi_n200 (best RNA encoder in multiprofile) and resnet50 (strong image encoder) using avgpool (effective in RNA-only multiprofile) and concat fusion. It isolates the effect of multimodal integration while building on established RNA and image encoder strengths, addressing uncertainty about whether combining these modalities improves performance beyond RNA-only baselines."
}

